WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.260
VidSearch is a lightweight multimodal video understanding and retrieval engine

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:13.440
It extracts key frames from video clips using ffmpeg

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:20.020
vidsearch/cli.py: is the command-line interface for VidSearch video retrieval engine

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:25.680
main: runs CLI search execution

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:31.440
Install: pip install -r requirements.txt

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.400
Run: python -m vidsearch.cli --query "sunset over ocean" --index index.faiss --fps 1.0

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:42.100
Pipeline Stages: decode, embed, index and query

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.470
Next step: open vidsearch/cli.py
